<title>USA: Parker holders increase authorized shares.</title>
<headline>Parker holders increase authorized shares.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Drilling Co said shareholders at the company's annual meeting approved a proposal increasing the number of authorized common stock to 120 million shares from 70 million.</p>
<p>The total number of shares outstanding at yearend was 65.3 million.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
